{"id": "EUVD-2026-96347", "enisaUuid": "1981109d-3b82-3fca-884e-3d1b3a10b0cd", "description": "OpenRefine through 3.10.1 contains a cross-site request forgery vulnerability in the get-rows command that allows remote attackers to execute Jython facet expressions. Attackers can lure a user to a malicious page issuing a cross-origin GET with a crafted engine parameter, executing operating system commands as the OpenRefine user.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T14:49:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T11:53:09", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/OpenRefine/OpenRefine/issues/7999", "https://github.com/OpenRefine/OpenRefine", "https://github.com/OpenRefine/OpenRefine/blob/bde8a36dc188f7846aeafc2910969e7d0fbc8e7c/main/src/com/google/refine/commands/row/GetRowsCommand.java#L174-L186", "https://github.com/OpenRefine/OpenRefine/blob/bde8a36dc188f7846aeafc2910969e7d0fbc8e7c/modules/core/src/main/java/com/google/refine/browsing/facets/ListFacet.java#L327-L339", "https://github.com/OpenRefine/OpenRefine/blob/bde8a36dc188f7846aeafc2910969e7d0fbc8e7c/extensions/jython/src/com/google/refine/jython/JythonEvaluable.java#L142", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openrefine-through-3.10.1-csrf-to-rce-via-get-rows-command"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108553", "GHSA-3fgg-hmv4-hp49"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c38b1b75-be48-3c72-8d16-87e7755882e3", "product": {"name": "OpenRefine", "vendor": {"name": "OpenRefine"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.10.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e4919b42-e3c3-3878-83be-be4bb053e50f", "vendor": {"name": "OpenRefine"}}], "isExploited": false}